<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="hero-title">安全生产管理平台</text><text>登录后查看培训、证书和本人安全生产事项</text></view><view class="card"><text class="title">手机号登录</text><text class="muted">手机号与在用人员档案唯一匹配后自动关联本人信息。</text><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="本人手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="setPhone"/><view class="code-row"><input class="field code-input" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="6 位验证码" value="{{smsCode}}" bindinput="setSmsCode"/><button class="secondary code-button" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{countdown > 0}}" bindtap="sendCode">{{countdown > 0 ? countdown + ' 秒' : '获取验证码'}}</button></view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="phoneLogin">手机号登录</button><view class="divider"></view><text class="title">微信认证登录</text><text class="muted">首次进入可使用微信手机号绑定已有档案；未匹配时提交管理员审核。</text><button class="secondary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">微信认证登录</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view></view>
